    "",
    "- Connect only to backends that you own or are authorized to manage.",
    "- Comply with the laws and regulations of your place of residence and of the People's Republic of China. Do not use the App or the services it manages to evade national network regulation, to infringe the lawful rights and interests of others, or for any other illegal activity.",
    "- You are solely responsible for the source of the backend you connect to and for the legality of the nodes and subscription content it provides. Any dispute, loss or legal liability arising from the backend or its content is yours alone.",
    "- Keep backend addresses and secrets safe. The consequences of poor safekeeping or disclosure of a secret are borne by you.",
