    "",
    "The backend you connect to, the icon URLs returned by the backend, and services involved in update checks — GitHub (for the GitHub channel build) or Huawei AppGallery (for the AppGallery channel build) — are provided by their respective operators and governed by their own terms and privacy policies. We give no guarantee as to the content or availability of third-party services. Disputes arising from your use of a third-party service should be resolved with that third party.",
    "",
