    "",
    "The rights to the App's interface design, icons and code belong to the developer. Third-party software names mentioned in the App are used only to describe API compatibility and belong to their respective owners. You may not reverse-engineer, decompile or tamper with the App, except where the law expressly permits it.",
    "",
    "## 5. Disclaimer and limitation of liability",
    "",
    "- The App is provided \"as is\". Because backend versions, network environments and devices vary, we do not guarantee that the App works in every environment, or that it will be uninterrupted or error-free.",
    "- To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for service interruptions, data loss or other losses caused by your backend configuration, network conditions, third-party software or force majeure.",
    "- You are responsible for the source of the backend and the legality of the nodes and subscription content it provides. We give no express or implied guarantee regarding a backend or its content, and the consequences of using a backend or its content are borne by you.",
    "- The App merely provides viewing and management operations against a backend. The consequences of those operations themselves (such as a node switch interrupting connections, or a configuration change making the backend misbehave) are borne by you as the operator.",
    "- Nothing in this agreement excludes or limits any liability that may not lawfully be excluded or limited, and nothing affects the statutory rights you enjoy as a consumer.",
    "",
    "## 6. Minors",
    "",
    "The App is intended for users who can deploy and manage a proxy core. Minors may use the App only with the guidance and consent of a guardian; if a guardian does not consent, the minor must stop using the App immediately.",
    "",
    "## 7. Changes and termination",
    "",
    "We may update this agreement as needed. The updated version will be published in the App and you will be asked for consent again together with the privacy consent version. If you do not accept the changes, you may stop using and uninstall the App. You may stop using the App at any time. The provisions on limitation of liability, intellectual property and dispute resolution survive termination.",
    "",
    "## 8. Governing law and dispute resolution",
    "",
    "This agreement is governed by and construed under the laws of the People's Republic of China. Any dispute arising from this agreement or the App shall first be resolved through friendly negotiation; if negotiation fails, either party may bring a suit before the people's court with jurisdiction at the developer's place of residence.",
    "",
    "## 9. Miscellaneous",
    "",
    "This agreement, together with the Mimi Panel Privacy Policy, constitutes the entire agreement between you and us regarding your use of the App. If any provision of this agreement is held invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in effect. Section headings are for convenience only and do not affect interpretation.",
